.
.  Generate sample output for chi-square PDF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na chspf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 6
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 5
TIC LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (1 df)
PLOT CHSPDF(X,1) FOR X = 0.0 0.01 10
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (2 df)
PLOT CHSPDF(X,2) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 10
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (5 df)
PLOT CHSPDF(X,5) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 10
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (10 df)
PLOT CHSPDF(X,10) FOR X = 0.01 0.01 10
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CHSPF4.PS chspf4.ps
quit
